WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.450
The DC Extended Universe has been struggling
to achieve the right tone to match wits with

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.210
its Marvel counterpart, but despite a few
hiccups, the franchise doesn't seem to be

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:09.960
slowing down anytime soon.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.460
"Ride ain't over yet."

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.460
"My man."

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.700
Warner Bros. has still got quite a few new
films on the roster for future development

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.880
that might just turn things around once and
for all, so here's what DC has in store for

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.590
superhero movie lovers next.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:24.590
Aquaman

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:28.760
He's been the butt of jokes for years, but
James Wan's Aquaman film looks to finally

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:31.340
bring some respect to the man who talks to
fish.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.580
Of course, casting burly Game of Thrones star
Jason Momoa in the title role didn't hurt.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:40.090
The film will give the eponymous hero a few
central foes, including Aquaman's half brother

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:43.790
the Ocean Master and arch-nemesis Black Manta.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:47.660
Making a feature-length film about the sea
hero is a risky venture, but Wan intends to

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:50.100
breathe new life into the watery comic character.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:55.330
"Well, I think there's a certain perception
of Aquaman, and I think part of the fun will

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:58.530
be to subvert that expectation."

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:02.570
Considering how well he's handled everything
from horror films to racecar dramas, audiences

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:07.810
will likely be in for an action-packed adventure
when this movie hits theaters December 21st,

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.149
2018.

00:01:09.149 --> 00:01:10.490
Shazam!

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:13.930
It's been in the works for years, but for
a while there it seemed like the long-awaited

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:15.439
adaptation of Shazam!

00:01:15.439 --> 00:01:17.579
Might never actually come to pass.

00:01:17.579 --> 00:01:21.500
Initial reports had Dwayne Johnson attached
to the film as the villainous Black Adam,

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.970
but DC later revealed that Johnson's character
would get his own film.

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:29.170
Instead, it'll be Chuck alum Zachary Levi
who handles the title role, with Annabelle:

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:31.740
Creation's David Sandberg directing the picture.

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:36.950
Levi has described the picture as being akin
to Tom Hanks' 1988 comedy favorite Big … only

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.289
with superpowers instead of a wish machine.

00:01:39.289 --> 00:01:41.569
"I don't get it."

00:01:41.569 --> 00:01:46.509
The movie is expected to launch production
in 2018, so get ready to giggle when Shazam!

00:01:46.509 --> 00:01:49.770
hits theaters on April 5th, 2019.

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:51.619
Wonder Woman 2

00:01:51.619 --> 00:01:55.289
The first sequel to the summer's smash hit
Wonder Woman was finally given an official

00:01:55.289 --> 00:02:00.259
announcement at San Diego Comic-Con, with
a release date set for November 1st, 2019

00:02:00.259 --> 00:02:01.829
shortly thereafter.

00:02:01.829 --> 00:02:05.450
After months of keeping fans in the dark,
director Patty Jenkins confirmed in early

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:10.039
September that she is officially set to return
for the sequel, and rumors suggest her salary

00:02:10.039 --> 00:02:11.140
could be historic.

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:15.599
"Promise me you will protect it with your
life."

00:02:15.599 --> 00:02:19.650
Jenkins and DC Studios head Geoff Johns are
teaming up with The Expendables' Dave Callaham

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:23.060
to work on the script, based on a treatment
from Jenkins and Johns.

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:27.349
With Jenkins saying she wants to take Diana
to America and rumors saying the film could

00:02:27.349 --> 00:02:32.260
take place in the 1980s, Wonder Woman 2 seems
like it will be an amazing ride.

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:36.180
And now that embattled producer Brett Ratner
is out of the picture, Gal Gadot is officially

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:37.530
a go for it, too.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:40.230
"Who will I be if I stay?"

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:41.540
Green Lantern Corps

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:45.939
The Green Lantern has certainly had a rough
history in Hollywood, with the Ryan Reynolds-led

00:02:45.939 --> 00:02:49.020
adaptation arriving as a laughing stock in
2011.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.819
"No thanks necessary, miss."

00:02:50.819 --> 00:02:53.549
But DC isn't done trying to make Hal Jordan
happen.

00:02:53.549 --> 00:02:57.650
David Goyer and Justin Rhodes are working
on a script to revive the fallen franchise,

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:01.500
with plans for the film to take flight on
July 24th, 2020.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:05.400
There's no word yet on the plot of the new
take, but it has been described as "Lethal

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:09.409
Weapon in space," and is reportedly based
on a comic book origin story.

00:03:09.409 --> 00:03:13.630
We also know it'll focus on two different
characters: the popular Lanterns Hal Jordan

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.220
and John Stewart.

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:18.719
Bringing Stewart in is a wise move since he's
a fan favorite, and getting him in the mix

00:03:18.719 --> 00:03:22.189
will help this film stand apart from its predecessor.

00:03:22.189 --> 00:03:23.540
Flashpoint

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:28.400
DC's Flash movie, starring Ezra Miller as
Barry Allen, has had a bit of a rocky road.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:32.900
The film first found a director in Pride and
Prejudice and Zombies' Seth Grahame-Smith,

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:37.120
but he dropped out and was followed by Rick
Famuyiwa, who also left.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:41.340
Rumors have put Matthew Vaughn, Robert Zemeckis,
and Sam Raimi in the mix, although it's unclear

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:44.969
as of the making of this video if talks are
moving forward with any of them.

00:03:44.969 --> 00:03:48.900
The script has also undergone quite a few
rewrites, with reports saying it was being

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.610
completely overhauled.

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:55.260
Concrete details about the film finally began
to be released at this year's Comic-Con, when

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:58.610
DC officially announced that the movie would
be titled Flashpoint.

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:02.999
This seems to suggest that the movie will
cover the famous 2011 comic storyline, which

00:04:02.999 --> 00:04:07.379
is a move that could have huge ripple effects
across the rest of the DCEU.

00:04:07.379 --> 00:04:08.560
"Oh, sh.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:09.560
Sorry."

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:12.739
Miller has been a consistent favorite in everything
he's appeared in so far.

00:04:12.739 --> 00:04:18.790
So, the pressure is on to get the speedy superhero
to the theaters sooner than later.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.700
"OKAY."

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:21.940
Cyborg

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:26.550
By the time Cyborg shows up in his solo movie,
fans should be pretty familiar with him.

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:29.470
"Relax Alfred, I'll take it from here."

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.560
"Uh, do I know you?"

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:35.880
After making half a cameo in Batman vs. Superman,
Ray Fisher's version of the character will

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:39.100
appear in Justice League and will appear in
Flashpoint.

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:43.290
While details are still slim as to what his
solo movie will entail, Fisher has said that

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:47.570
if he had his pick of the villainous litter
as to who he'll fight it'd be the Phantom

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:48.570
Limbs.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:49.880
The Batman

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:52.640
Batman has long been the cash cow of the DC
universe.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.610
But as much as Warner Bros. wants to get a
standalone movie going with Ben Affleck's

00:04:56.610 --> 00:05:00.230
version of the Dark Knight, the project has
been very troubled.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:04.620
Not only have there been numerous script rewrites
and Affleck stepping back from the director's

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:08.960
chair, he's now said to want a "cool" way
to escape the cape altogether.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:12.730
He's since clarified that he's still planning
to take the role, but reports on his commitment

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:16.170
to being the Caped Crusader have given DC
fans a bit of whiplash.

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:20.370
Meanwhile, the film has tapped War for the
Planet of the Apes' Matt Reeves to take the

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:24.720
helm, and he's supposedly got a guy in mind
to take over for Affleck if the situation

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:25.720
calls for it.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:29.580
Whether "Batfleck" takes flight again or not,
Joe Manganiello's Deathstroke is expected

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:34.360
to be the central villain, which should make
for one beefy bonanza indeed.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:35.830
Dark Universe

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:40.840
Also known as Justice League Dark, Dark Universe
is set to focus on the mystical side of things

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:45.830
with characters such as John Constantine,
Swamp Thing, Deadman, Zatanna, and Etrigan

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:46.830
the Demon.

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:50.520
Edge of Tomorrow's Doug Liman was initially
signed on to direct, but he dropped out due

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:54.530
to scheduling conflicts, and the film has
yet to find a new director as script changes

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:55.930
are underway.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:06:00.030
Considering the success Marvel had with its
similarly otherworldly Doctor Strange, it

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:04.250
stands to reason Warner Bros. will be keen
to get this one off the bench soon.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.310
Gotham City Sirens

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:10.710
While Suicide Squad 2 is also in the barrel,
David Ayer will first tackle this Harley Quinn-centric

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:15.650
spinoff with Margot Robbie and other female
heroes and villains across the DC Comics canon,

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:18.780
called the Gotham City Sirens.

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:20.920
"What?!"

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:24.740
No word on which characters will show up,
though players like Catwoman and Poison Ivy

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:26.690
seem like prime candidates.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:30.760
Along with getting a Wonder Woman movie out
before Marvel could make Captain Marvel, DC

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:35.310
has an excellent opportunity take the edge
in female-led superhero fare, which could

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:40.170
be a huge move for a studio playing catch-up…
that is, as long as the movies are good.

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.050
"I'm known to be quite vexing.

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:43.660
I'm just forewarning you."

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.640
Justice League 2

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:49.710
Warner Bros. originally penciled this one
in for 2019, though it's since been bumped

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:53.180
to an unspecified date to clear out some space
for The Batman.

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:57.260
But of all the projects at the far end of
DC's master plan, it stands to reason another

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:59.460
Justice League is one of the most bankable.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:03.560
The Avengers has become a flagship franchise
for Marvel, and DC is looking to leverage

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.490
Justice League the same way.

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:09.260
It'll just have to wait until after a couple
of stand-alone films.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:10.960
Man of Steel 2

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:15.110
It's the worst-kept secret in movie history
that Superman returns for the Justice League

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:17.690
film, despite the events of Dawn of Justice.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:21.880
But the studio doesn't seem to be in a major
hurry to give him another solo adventure,

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:25.760
even though Man of Steel was technically the
inaugural installment of this franchise.

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:29.250
The cast has confirmed a script is in the
works, but with so many other movies on the

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:33.650
docket, it could be years until they actually
get around to making this one, but when they

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:38.170
do, it'll surely be a brave new adventure
for the big blue boyscout.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:39.740
Suicide Squad 2

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:44.690
A proper Suicide Squad sequel is in development,
but there's been no word on when it'll actually

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.070
hit the big screen.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:49.680
Despite terrible reviews, the first film still
made a whole lot of money—and introduced

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:52.580
characters like Robbie's Harley Quinn, and
Will Smith's Deadshot.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:55.650
"You might want to work on your team motivation
thing."

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:59.810
The Accountant's Gavin O'Connor has officially
signed on to direct and rewrite the script,

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:04.220
so with a behind-the-scenes team finally coming
together, it looks like the rumored Fall of

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:08.590
2018 production start date isn't so unreasonable
after all.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:09.900
Nightwing

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:14.420
The Lego Batman Movie's Chris McKay will take
on live-action superheroes in DC's planned

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:15.650
Nightwing movie.

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:19.310
The film is being scripted by The Accountant's
Bill Dubuque, and, although it doesn't have

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:23.310
a star yet, the acrobatic shoes of Dick Grayson
are going to be fun to fill.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:28.200
Because according to McKay, he's not going
to be relying on CGI to make his, "badass

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:29.700
action movie" happen.

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:30.780
Batgirl

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:35.409
After taking over the helm of Justice League
from Zach Snyder, Joss Whedon will next write,

00:08:35.409 --> 00:08:38.440
direct, and product an adaptation of Batgirl
for the DCEU.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:43.670
The title role is rumored to follow the New
52 version of Barbara Gordon and offer a darker

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:48.440
version of the character's storyline, featuring
her using experimental surgery to recover

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:51.690
from a severe spinal injury inflicted by the
Joker.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:55.420
With the amazing success of Wonder Woman,
it makes sense that DC is pursuing Batgirl,

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:59.700
and it wouldn't be surprising to see them
push the movie ahead quickly.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:01.280
Lobo

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:04.970
Word leaked last year that Warner Bros. is
looking to bring the space bounty hunter Lobo

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:09.380
to the DCEU, after a Guy Ritchie adaptation
fell through a few years back.

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:13.070
And Wonder Woman's Jason Fuchs is reportedly
working on the script now.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:17.020
The new project is apparently a fresh take
on the character, and considering the success

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:21.440
Fox and Marvel have had with Deadpool, Lobo
could be a foul-mouthed sweet spot for DC

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:23.850
to get in on the four-letter action, too.

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:25.180
Deadshot

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:29.240
Will Smith is a Hollywood star, so it's no
surprise Warner Bros. is looking to spin him

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:32.840
off with a film focused on his Suicide Squad
character Deadshot.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:37.220
Outside of Ben Affleck, Smith is arguably
the biggest star in the DCEU—so it's only

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:41.240
a matter of time until they get him suited
back up for another fight against Batman.

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:45.280
Even so, the project is still very early on
in development, so no release date has been

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:47.090
established just yet.

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:48.210
Black Adam

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:52.830
Dwayne "The Rock" Johnson has been attached
to co-star in a Shazam movie for years, playing

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:57.930
the villain Black Adam, but Warner Bros. is
now developing a full-fledged Black Adam spinoff

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:00.900
film, which will split the character off into
more of an antihero.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:06.230
It remains to be seen how DC will juggle a
two-pronged side section of the DCEU while

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:09.440
they're still trying to establish the main
universe—but in the meantime, we've done

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.700
a little Photoshop to imagine how Johnson
will look in character.

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:15.610
Joker's origin story

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:20.300
The Joker is one of DC's most popular characters,
so it makes sense that they're taking yet

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:24.890
another stab at bringing him to the big screen—and
this time, with a planned solo movie about

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.450
the character's origins.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:30.380
The movie is said to explore what it took
for the Joker to become a criminal mastermind,

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:32.670
using an '80s setting as a backdrop.

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:36.430
While it will obviously draw heavily from
the comic books, it's supposedly intended

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:40.760
to feel more like a gritty crime drama than
a superhero film, and is said to be separate

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:44.230
from any other iteration of the Joker in the
DCEU.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:48.090
The movie is set to be co-written and directed
by The Hangover's Todd Phillips, with The

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:50.690
Fighter's Scott Silver joining as a co-writer.

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:55.200
Don't expect to see Jared Leto in the lead—Phillips
apparently wants to recast the Suicide Squad

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:59.050
star, which makes sense considering the movie's
different time period and separation from

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:01.190
the rest of DC's films.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:05.260
According to the Hollywood Reporter, Martin
Scorsese is attached to the film as a producer,

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:09.441
and sources say that Warner Bros. is looking
to secure Leonardo DiCaprio for the role of

00:11:09.441 --> 00:11:10.441
the Joker.

00:11:10.441 --> 00:11:15.010
In response to the rumored casting possibility,
artist Royy Ledger drew some amazing concept

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:17.980
art of what a DiCaprio Joker would look like.

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:19.770
Joker and Harley Quinn's movie

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:24.560
Jared Leto is, however, expected to reprise
his role alongside Margot Robbie's Harley

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:29.360
Quinn in their own film, which has been described
as "When Harry Met Sally on benzedrine."

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:34.370
To that end, the studio has recruited a duo
familiar with romance, with This Is Us's Glenn

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:37.610
Ficarra and John Requa in final talks to write
and direct.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:42.210
The pair also already have experience working
with Robbie, having directed her in both Focus

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:44.230
and Whiskey Tango Foxtrot.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:48.230
While the movie doesn't have a release date
yet, it could be on the way soon.

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:52.750
Insiders say the plan is to fast-track the
movie after the upcoming Suicide Squad 2,

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:56.490
with the timeline being pushed up thanks to
the actors' holding agreements.

00:11:56.490 --> 00:12:00.350
While it may seem like we're getting Joker
overload with the Suicide Squad sequel and

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:03.980
the character's planned origin story movie,
this film is said to be further along.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:09.880
(laughing)

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.050
Thanks for watching!

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:14.230
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:16.389
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

